  "authzLadder": {
    "//": "The tenant floor on BOTH inheritance layouts (#3954): every read path of a TPH subtype (the restricted `Car`, the plain sibling `Truck`), of a TPC subtype (`Driver`) and of each abstract base's polymorphic read, re-read as tenant `globex` after `acme` seeds.  A collection read answers 200 either way, so its arm asserts the seeded row is ABSENT from the body; `byPlateAnyTenant` is the one surface that `ignoring tenantOwned`, so there the foreign tenant must SEE it — the control that proves the absent arms can fail.",
